HaxLean/Rust/Data/Coinductive/
------------------------------

CoInd.lean, Effect.lean and ITree.lean are the coinductive types and
interaction trees of the Aeneas Lean library, which adapts them from
ISTA-PLV/coinductive (https://github.com/ISTA-PLV/coinductive):

  Repository: https://github.com/AeneasVerif/aeneas
  Commit:     b08bf81f2524ee295a8c37444893acfc9c5f4dde
  Directory:  backends/lean/Aeneas/Data/Coinductive/
  License:    BSD 3-Clause (LICENSE in the same directory)
  Copyright:  the coinductive contributors

The files are changed only where Lean v4.35 and the hax-lean options
require it: explicit universe declarations in place of auto-bound ones,
and proofs completed after a `simp` that no longer closes the goal. Each
file names its source file in its header. HaxLean/Rust/ITreeResult.lean
transcribes the interaction-tree result monad of Aeneas
(backends/lean/Aeneas/Std/Primitives.lean at the same commit) and relates
it to the ported flat `RustM`.
